 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg5-00",
   "text": "换两种框架，单点换了位置。",
   "spoken": "换两种框架，单点换了位置。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg5-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.264,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 4.031
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-01",
   "text": "Corda 不广播交易，数据只发给需要知道的参与方。",
   "spoken": "Corda 不广播交易，数据只发给需要知道的参与方。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg5-01.mp3",
   "start": 5.084,
   "dur": 4.488,
   "speechStart": 5.182,
   "speechEnd": 8.753
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-02",
   "text": "防止同一个状态被花两次，靠的是公证人。",
   "spoken": "防止同一个状态被花两次，靠的是公证人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg5-02.mp3",
   "start": 9.792,
   "dur": 4.272,
   "speechStart": 9.89,
   "speechEnd": 13.223
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-03",
   "text": "非验证型公证人只看输入引用，看不到完整交易，隐私更好。",
   "spoken": "非验证型公证人只看输入引用，看不到完整交易，隐私更好。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg5-03.mp3",
   "start": 14.284,
   "dur": 6.048,
   "speechStart": 14.382,
   "speechEnd": 19.501
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-04",
   "text": "可如果整个网络只有一个公证人，运营方作恶，就能给同一个状态签两次，造成双花。",
   "spoken": "可如果整个网络只有一个公证人，运营方作恶，就能给同一个状态签两次，造成双花。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg5-04.mp3",
   "start": 20.552,
   "dur": 7.224,
   "speechStart": 20.65,
   "speechEnd": 26.935
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-05",
   "text": "防御是改成集群，分给不同的运营方。",
   "spoken": "防御是改成集群，分给不同的运营方。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg5-05.mp3",
   "start": 27.996,
   "dur": 3.96,
   "speechStart": 28.094,
   "speechEnd": 31.117
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-06",
   "text": "节点之间协商时，对方发来的数据，要先校验，再使用。",
   "spoken": "节点之间协商时，对方发来的数据，要先较验，再使用。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg5-06.mp3",
   "start": 32.176,
   "dur": 5.472,
   "speechStart": 32.274,
   "speechEnd": 36.809
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-07",
   "text": "合约代码作为附件随交易分发，always-accept 这种约束只用于测试，生产环境不能用。",
   "spoken": "合约代码作为附件随交易分发，always-accept 这种约束只用于测试，生产环境不能用。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg5-07.mp3",
   "start": 37.868,
   "dur": 7.248,
   "speechStart": 37.966,
   "speechEnd": 44.287
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-08",
   "text": "再看 Besu。",
   "spoken": "再看 Besu。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg5-08.mp3",
   "start": 45.336,
   "dur": 1.944,
   "speechStart": 45.434,
   "speechEnd": 46.457
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-09",
   "text": "2026 年 9 月，Besu 公布了一项 QBFT 漏洞。",
   "spoken": "2026 年 9 月，Besu 公布了一项 QBFT 漏洞。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg5-09.mp3",
   "start": 47.5,
   "dur": 4.656,
   "speechStart": 47.598,
   "speechEnd": 51.324
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-10",
   "text": "启用 Shanghai 及之后的分叉，一名拜占庭验证者，能注入未经授权的提款。",
   "spoken": "启用 Shanghai 及之后的分岔，一名拜占庭验证者，能注入未经授权的提款。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg5-10.mp3",
   "start": 52.376,
   "dur": 6.432,
   "speechStart": 52.474,
   "speechEnd": 57.962
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-11",
   "text": "诚实的验证者照常执行，照常确定，原生币凭空多了出来。",
   "spoken": "诚实的验证者照常执行，照常确定，原生币凭空多了出来。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg5-11.mp3",
   "start": 59.028,
   "dur": 5.808,
   "speechStart": 59.126,
   "speechEnd": 63.995
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-12",
   "text": "4 个验证者，按规范只容忍 1 个作恶。",
   "spoken": "4 个验证者，按规范只容忍 1 个作恶。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg5-12.mp3",
   "start": 65.056,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 65.154,
   "speechEnd": 68.296
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-13",
   "text": "可这一次，诚实节点的验证规则本身缺了一项，一名验证者就够了。",
   "spoken": "可这一次，诚实节点的验证规则本身缺了一项，一名验证者就够了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg5-13.mp3",
   "start": 69.356,
   "dur": 6.024,
   "speechStart": 69.454,
   "speechEnd": 74.573
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-14",
   "text": "合同能让你事后追责，却拦不住状态被写错。",
   "spoken": "合同能让你事后追责，却拦不住状态被写错。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg5-14.mp3",
   "start": 75.6,
   "dur": 3.984,
   "speechStart": 75.698,
   "speechEnd": 78.745
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-15",
   "text": "同一时期的另一项公告里，能连上足够多验证者端口的节点，用大体积提案，就能阻止网络最终确定。",
   "spoken": "同一时期的另一项公告里，能连上足够多验证者端口的节点，用大体积提案，就能阻止网络最终确定。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg5-15.mp3",
   "start": 79.804,
   "dur": 8.352,
   "speechStart": 79.902,
   "speechEnd": 87.306
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-16",
   "text": "所以 P2P 监听也是攻击面，要在网络层限制谁能连到验证者。",
   "spoken": "所以 P2P 监听也是攻击面，要在网络层限制谁能连到验证者。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg5-16.mp3",
   "start": 88.376,
   "dur": 6.048,
   "speechStart": 88.474,
   "speechEnd": 93.593
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-17",
   "text": "Besu 的本地准入规则只管本节点，每个成员都要配置，并且核对一致。",
   "spoken": "Besu 的本地准入规则只管本节点，每个成员都要配置，并且核对一致。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg5-17.mp3",
   "start": 94.644,
   "dur": 6.456,
   "speechStart": 94.742,
   "speechEnd": 100.265
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-18",
   "text": "还有一种风险，没有漏洞也会发生。",
   "spoken": "还有一种风险，没有漏洞也会发生。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg5-18.mp3",
   "start": 101.32,
   "dur": 3.384,
   "speechStart": 101.418,
   "speechEnd": 103.87
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-19",
   "text": "GoQuorum 的仓库已经归档，Tessera 已经弃用。",
   "spoken": "GoQuorum 的仓库已经归档，Tessera 已经弃用。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg5-19.mp3",
   "start": 104.924,
   "dur": 4.176,
   "speechStart": 105.022,
   "speechEnd": 108.26
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-20",
   "text": "还在用它们的网络，从此没有上游的安全修复。",
   "spoken": "还在用它们的网络，从此没有上游的安全修复。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg5-20.mp3",
   "start": 109.32,
   "dur": 4.296,
   "speechStart": 109.418,
   "speechEnd": 112.763
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-21",
   "text": "依赖这些功能的网络，只能自己维护，或者尽快迁移。",
   "spoken": "依赖这些功能的网络，只能自己维护，或者尽快迁移。",
